==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*30 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Malizabeth]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*3 [[Madam Peng]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Director Kurosawah having 400,000 health means that he will take a long while before he goes down. Has high damage can destroy your defenses but since he takes a while to attack, you can easily wear him down with units like [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]], [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] and more. Dark Lazer and Ring Girl Cat can also be useful for the decently strong Madam Pengs, and Aku Doge and Malizabeths easily die to [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Red Nyanko Ranger]] with the help of [[Yellow Strike (Combo)|Yellow Strike]].

